cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this bound or use this package, please cite it."
title: "A kissing configuration of 200540 points in R^27"
abstract: >-
  A verification package for the lower bound K(27) >= 200540, improving the
  previous record of 200044 by 496.  The configuration reuses the Leech minimal
  vectors, the twelve cap directions, the twelve axis points and four of the
  five direction classes of the published dimension-27 configuration, changing
  only which classes sit on which cap directions.  The package verifies the
  configuration in exact arithmetic over Z[sqrt2, sqrt3, sqrt6], twice, by
  independent routes and with no floating-point tolerance in any decision.
authors:
